       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That's twice the maximum labeled daily dose for adults, which is 3,200 mg/day by prescription. At that level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up substantially.\n\nThese options are within the labeled limits:\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), which is the maximum.\n- **600 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (2,400 mg/day).\n- **400 mg by mouth, every 4\u20136 hours as needed** for pain or fever. A single dose shouldn't exceed 800 mg.\n\nTell me which dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you meant 1600 mg as the total daily dose, for example 400 mg four times daily, I can enter that too."
